# Product Category Appearance

## Data model

Strapi `product-category` fields used for storefront cards:

| Field | Status | Usage |
|-------|--------|-------|
| `Image` | Active | Single full-bleed category photo |
| `Color` | **Deprecated** | Kept in schema/DB for rollback; not fetched or edited in UI |

Child categories have `Image` stripped in `lifecycles.ts` (parent-only appearance).

## Shared component

Use [`CategoryCard`](apps/frontend/src/components/Categories/CategoryCard.tsx) for all storefront category tiles:

- **Proportion:** `aspect-[227/310]`, `rounded-3xl`
- **Image:** `next/image` `fill` + `object-cover`
- **Label:** bottom gradient overlay + white centered text (Figma node `21:1985`)
- **Sizes:** `carousel` (default) | `compact` (bottom-nav sheet)
- **Responsive:** Mobile (`<lg`) — same image clipped in a circle (`rounded-full`, `object-cover`), label below. Desktop (`lg+`) — full-bleed portrait card with gradient overlay label.

[`CategoryCarousel`](apps/frontend/src/components/Categories/CategoryCarousel.tsx) wraps cards in RTL-aware horizontal scroll; do not duplicate card styling elsewhere.

## API / types

- Storefront: `getProductCategories()` → `ProductCategorySummary` (no `color` field)
- Image format preference: `large` → `medium` → `small` → `thumbnail` → raw `url`
- Super-admin create/update: send `Image` only (omit `Color`)

## Super-admin

- [`CategoryAppearancePanel`](apps/frontend/src/app/(super-admin)/super-admin/products/categories/CategoryAppearancePanel.tsx): image upload/preview only
- List preview cards in [`table.tsx`](apps/frontend/src/app/(super-admin)/super-admin/products/categories/table.tsx) use `object-cover` + gradient label

## Migration

Existing categories reuse their current `Image` media. No automated migration. Admins may re-upload cover-friendly photos where old assets were small cutouts for `object-contain`.
